a2fdd354d17" :question/math-academy-id "q-160055" :question/is-example false :question/problem "Mark jogs every day in the neighborhood park. Last week he ran the following distances, in kilometers:\n\n$$\n1\\,\\text{km},\\,3\\,\\text{km},\\,2\\,\\text{km},\\,3\\,\\text{km},\\,1\\,\\text{km},\\,1\\,\\text{km},\\,3\\,\\text{km}\n$$\n\nWhat is the mean distance Mark jogged last week?" :question/worked-solution "If we have a data set that consists of the points ${x}_{1},{x}_{2},…,{x}_{n},$ then the mean is denoted by $\\overset{―}{x}$ and is given by the following formula:\n\n$$\n\\overset{―}{x}=\\frac{1}{n}{\\sum }_{i=1}^{n}{x}_{i}\n$$\n\nHere, there are $n=7$ data points. Adding up all the points in the data set, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\sum }_{i=1}^{7}{x}_{i} & =1+3+2+3+1+1+3\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the mean is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{―}{x} & =\\frac{1}{n}{\\sum }_{i=1}^{n}{x}_{i} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{7}\\cdot 14 \\\\  & =2\\,\\text{km}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-160055/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "adfc527d-4347-5741-a81c-fa91c50d5d74"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-160055"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-160052/selection/4c919dd28b6dc49158e4bc0cd4ecb2267c6fa1a0cbd5673af1ca376ab1c8a23e" :answer/id #uuid "ef7fabe9-edab-565c-bb0c-44b53d5d1cd9" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "9.5" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-160052/selection/478cbf1ea235fbfb5b60a0837fffa0a678f83a3bcb8f958a024b0760ea2175ce" :answer/id #uuid "0a783cdf-195d-5593-94ce-2632b5430bef" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "11" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-160052/selection/56019ff80d11d678dbd5eca83c729f420f1b6a8ad4259032846618d6b48aa0bc" :answer/id #uuid "00dd2b77-c46d-52b4-b755-4a82f06de514" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "10" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-160052/selectio