\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{―}{x} & =\\frac{1}{n}{\\sum }_{i=1}^{n}{x}_{i} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{5}\\cdot 50 \\\\  & =10.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-160052/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "adfc527d-4347-5741-a81c-fa91c50d5d74"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-160052"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id [:question/math-academy-id "q-86561"] :question/worked-solution "If we have a data set that consists of the points ${x}_{1},{x}_{2},…,{x}_{n},$ then the mean is denoted by $\\overset{―}{x}$ and is given by the following formula:\n\n$$\n\\overset{―}{x}=\\frac{1}{n}{\\sum }_{i=1}^{n}{x}_{i}\n$$\n\nHere, there are $n=8$ data points. Adding up all the points in the data set, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\sum }_{i=1}^{5}{x}_{i} & =9+4+3+9+12+5+6+8 \\\\  & =56.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the mean is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{―}{x} & =\\frac{1}{n}{\\sum }_{i=1}^{n}{x}_{i} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{8}\\cdot 56 \\\\  & =7.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "q-160054/selection/a0e0e68f25b8b46aafef3b74aff7beff7fddc6de5bf36921680b04c7b0e6ffaa" :answer/id #uuid "31cfa1d7-3621-575e-a150-60362c7f13a5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "6" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-160054/selection/908d1d9015b4446f7f4613238506c21dfacedd5aec03544c694256ff366be30b" :answer/id #uuid "f174357f-a317-50de-9318-aa9b1e22ad3f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "6.8" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-160054/selection/eadb4f132857861f1e64373661b9a01bc3625cc86bcffcc32659fc4899904fe0" :answer/id #uuid "ab522a5a-b84c-56be-ba8e-2bf00afcb7b4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "5" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-160054/selection/0f5647700b933a18d4c924b388250a52d426eab8923c02afed2168e950a0d65a" :answer/id #uuid "7ba2d301-bbfc-5222-b22f-da43a