mple false :question/problem "Given that the mean of the following data set is $8,$ find the value of $w:$ \n\n$$\n7,\\,w,\\,8,\\,5,\\,11,\\,(w-1)\n$$" :question/worked-solution "If we have a data set that consists of the points ${x}_{1},{x}_{2},…,{x}_{n},$ then the mean is denoted by $\\overset{―}{x}$ and is given by the following formula:\n\n$$\n\\overset{―}{x}=\\frac{1}{n}{\\sum }_{i=1}^{n}{x}_{i}\n$$\n\nHere, there are $n=6$ data points. Adding up all the points in the data set, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\sum }_{i=1}^{6}{x}_{i} & =7+w+8+5+11+(w-1) \\\\  & =30+2w.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the mean is given by the expression\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{―}{x} & =\\frac{1}{n}{\\sum }_{i=1}^{n}{x}_{i} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{6}\\cdot (30+2w) \\\\  & =\\frac{30+2w}{6}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, since we're told that $\\overset{―}{x}=8,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}8 & =\\frac{30+2w}{6} \\\\ 48 & =30+2w \\\\ 18 & =2w \\\\ w & =9.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["q-86951/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "b346e7e1-b641-5a97-9677-84a0ff6ab2dc"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-86951"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-160026/selection/0f0db3a18f1d79c4863315eefe754cc5306e04e7aeebf4414ffedb95d6f1bc97" :answer/id #uuid "da69989c-90f8-5501-9588-1527d14f3f72" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "12" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-160026/selection/56019ff80d11d678dbd5eca83c729f420f1b6a8ad4259032846618d6b48aa0bc" :answer/id #uuid "b2dcc8ba-eb9a-5402-a2c2-c42b668c19e5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "10" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-160026/selection/650efaaa01beaa7de6c030497edff1dd29c570bf683f3726bbcacabc3dfa7e4c" :answer/id #uuid "64eb1e45-b255-563a-bf89-5866f71d9c5b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "16" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-160026/selection/83c2285763389b0bc8b